{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191749-various-questions-on-aeon-trinity-2123","id":1191749,"title":"Various questions on AEON Trinity 2123","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-04T14:42:43-08:00","id":1191749,"title":"Various questions on AEON Trinity 2123","content":"As I am working through a mild headache, my memory is being iffy ATM.. As I am piling through the manuscripts, I had a few questions:<br /> <br /> 1. Is Fusion power now a workable thing in AEON? I've been looking and am Unsure.<br /> <br /> 2. are small computers capable of displaying holograms?<br /> <br /> 3. Are the asteroid belts being mined?<br /> <br /> 4. What about Mercury and the Jovian system for research?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T23:42:56-08:00","id":1191857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191749-various-questions-on-aeon-trinity-2123#post1191749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. Is Fusion power now a workable thing in AEON? I've been looking and am Unsure.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Novas invented hyperfusion in the decades before the Aberrant War and it's still in use.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191749-various-questions-on-aeon-trinity-2123#post1191749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. are small computers capable of displaying holograms?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't think it's explicitly called out in the current text, but I think in 1e they could and I don't think there's a reason to think that's changed.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191749-various-questions-on-aeon-trinity-2123#post1191749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. Are the asteroid belts being mined?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191749-various-questions-on-aeon-trinity-2123#post1191749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4. What about Mercury and the Jovian system for research?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, regarding the Jovians, but I don't think there's anything called out regarding Mercury other than that there's some interest in mining it.<br /> <br /> Hope that helps and that your headache clears up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-05T19:46:22-08:00","id":1192122,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the help. that will be useful for long term planning","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","va